## Complexity Comparison

| Approach | Time Complexity | Space Complexity |
|----------|-----------------|------------------|
| Brute Force (Recursion) | O(n³) | O(n) |
| Better (Group Counting) | O(n) | O(n) |
| Optimized (Two Pointers) | O(n) | O(1) |

